"""bt -- Building Tools Blender session controller.

Manages a persistent Blender session for validating addon changes:
start/stop Blender, run code in the live session, hot-reload the addon
from this repo, and capture screenshots for visual analysis.

Usage: bt <command> [options]   (see `bt --help`)
"""

